{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"Water purification?\" Demetrius asks. \"To be honest because of the bleeds there isn't really need for them on the ferrytown side. The water that passes by our borders tends to get cleaned by the ambient magic. but it definitely doesn't catch all of it.\" He shrugs. \"The woodsmith is definitely a good call. That dort of stuff's their area mostly.\"","created_at":"2021-08-27T07:37:04.830000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"880717541482324000","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"Right, you might not have been here for the whole thing when I mentioned it earlier. I'll be turning some of our airships into pumps that will sieve out all the gunk that was put there by the redcoats' operations. Definitely most of them on this side of the Hudson.\"","created_at":"2021-08-27T07:38:41.748000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"880717947985854475","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"If you won't need them on the other bank, then it's even better, but I just wanted to let people on both sides of the river know.\"","created_at":"2021-08-27T07:39:20.603000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"880718110955552778","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
